    "name": "ViewTube",
    "description": "# ViewTube\n\nThe ViewTube collection represents a backend API for a video platform (similar to YouTube) built with Express.  \nIt focuses on **user authentication**, **profile management**, and **basic channel data**.\n\n#### Base URL is provided via the `{{domain}}` environment variable, for example:\n\n`{{domain}}/users/...`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "47329487"
  },
